WEBVTT

00:05:32.321 --> 00:05:35.507
[1788 - Great Britain penal
transportation to Australia starts]

00:05:35.531 --> 00:05:37.458
[1836 - First migrants use Oregon Trail]

00:05:38.149 --> 00:05:41.332
[all activity]

00:05:43.851 --> 00:05:45.394
I love this movie.

00:05:45.418 --> 00:05:50.511
Now, since these migration events
are giving the context of families,

00:05:50.535 --> 00:05:52.718
we can ask questions such as:

00:05:52.742 --> 00:05:56.212
What is the typical distance
between the birth locations

00:05:56.236 --> 00:05:59.048
of husbands and wives?

00:05:59.072 --> 00:06:02.749
This distance plays
a pivotal role in demography,